{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887064.mp3","text":"Kaunsihatukkõin tuli, katsob, uhsi on avõ, meeb rihhe."}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887158.mp3","text":"Nämäd õlla laizgad i eväd suvva tehhä tüüte."}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887083.mp3","text":"repo on pesumašinõz"}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887089.mp3","text":"irvi on čirkkõz"}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887112.mp3","text":"lentäjä eb õõ mettsez"}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887146.mp3","text":"Vikahtõ viippezi."}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887117.mp3","text":"lentäjä Petteriz"}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887088.mp3","text":"politseinikkõ on lavgöz"}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887096.mp3","text":"jänez on Jõgõperäll"}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887149.mp3","text":"Tänäve piäb õlla mitäle erinomaissõ."}
{"audio":"vot/unknown/vot_u_19887138.mp3","text":"Pädrä õli Jõgõperälle kõikka suurõp praaznikkõ."}
